<title>UK: Guardian trade profit slips to 281 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Guardian trade profit slips to 281 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31 1996</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		48.7		   vs 77.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.0		   vs 9.0</p>
<p> Total premium income   3,732		  vs 3,776</p>
<p> Trading profit	   281		    vs 340</p>
<p> Investment income	409		    vs 472</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 238 million stg and 280 million stg. Trading profits were before restructuring costs of 39 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Guardian Royal Exchange Plc</p>
